<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/verificationUID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The unique identifier used by a verification management system or any other lifecycle management tool to uniquely identify a verification item."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/webpage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/webpage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType> .
