<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/ancestorOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Element is an ancestor of each `to` Element."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/assumes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/assumes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/assumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assumes" .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/assumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Element assumes each `to` Assumption."@en .
