<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexFixedVulnAssessmentRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexFixedVulnAssessmentRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a vulnerability and elements representing products (in the VEX sense) where\na fix has been applied and are no longer affected."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexFixedVulnAssessmentRelationship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/VexVulnAssessmentRelationship> .
