<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "custody" .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/custody> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Custody refers to the responsibility, control, and safekeeping of an asset, person, or legal entity. It involves both physical possession and legal authority over something or someone."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ownership" .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/ResponsibilityType/ownership> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ownership refers to the legal right to control, manage, and benefit from an asset, resource, or responsibility. It establishes authority, accountability, and entitlements over something, whether it's property, a business, intellectual property, or responsibilities."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/responsibilityCategory> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/responsibilityCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Requirements can be categorized into various types based on their focus, purpose, and scope."@en .
